They replace three modules inside ghcr.io/tonyd2wild/vllm-glm53-flash:sm121-v11-dflash2
so MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL tensor-parallel 2 loads on GB10:

- mimo_v2.py — fused FP8 QKV sharding at the checkpoint's TP, and FP8 KV cache_config
- mimo_v2_omni.py — SupportsEagle3 so the bundled DFlash drafter can attach
- triton_attn_diffkv.py — DiffKV attention accepts FP8 KV

The upstream DFlash value-scale patch is not included. Their bench measured no change.
